slide('Work RVUs are one component of total RVUs','Relative value units describe resources, not cash.',cards(('Work','Professional time, effort, judgment and skill.'),('Practice expense','Staff, equipment, supplies and space; values depend on setting.'),('Malpractice','Relative professional liability expense.'))+call('<strong>wRVU ≠ total RVU ≠ collections.</strong> The employment agreement defines which work receives productivity credit.'),['R1','R6'],'01 / Understand value')
