slide('Match the fee schedule to the service date','Annual policy changes do not rewrite every employment contract.',cards(('2026 Medicare CF','Approximately <strong>$33.57</strong> for qualifying APM participants and <strong>$33.40</strong> for other participants.'),('Setting + locality','Verify the facility/nonfacility value and geographic inputs.'),('Contract version','Confirm the RVU year and attribution rules used by your employer.'))+call('These are 2026 examples, not 2027 rates. Use the applicable year and current fee-schedule file for an actual claim.'),['R6','R8'],'01 / Understand value')
