slide('Use modifier 25 to describe supported separate E/M work','Attach it to the E/M code when applicable, not to the scan.',flow('Separate work?','Documentation supports it?','Payer requires modifier?')+cards(('Describe','Make the additional evaluation and management identifiable in the record.'),('Verify','Check same-day payer edits and the correct code/modifier relationship.'))+call('A different diagnosis is not inherently required. A different diagnosis alone also does not prove separate work.'),['R15'],'03 / Imaging and co-management')
slide('Imaging has professional and technical components','Billing follows the furnished component and arrangement.',cards(('Professional · 26','Interpretation and report, when the code supports component billing.'),('Technical · TC','Equipment, acquisition and related technical resources.'),('Global service','Both components, only when the billing entity is entitled to report both.'))+reveal('Hospital example','Signing the ultrasound report does not establish ownership of the hospital’s technical service. Verify the professional billing arrangement.'),['R6','R8'],'03 / Imaging and co-management')
