slide('Reconcile MFM co-management with maternity billing','Clarify responsibility for routine care and complication management.',
 '<div class="lanes"><article class="card"><span class="tag">Referring obstetric team</span><h3>Routine maternity care</h3><p>Identify what the maternity package covers and who provides it.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="tag">MFM team</span><h3>Consultation + specialized care</h3><p>Identify distinct problem management, imaging and procedures.</p></article></div>'+call('Confirm the payer’s rules and same-group arrangements. Neither “all bundled” nor “all separate” is a reliable universal rule.'),['R7'],'03 / Imaging and co-management')
