slide('Case: FGR imaging and a separate management encounter','Physician track · fictional scenario · fetal growth restriction (FGR).',
 '<div class="case"><span class="tag">Two documented activities</span><h3>The physician interprets the scan, then conducts a distinct management visit.</h3><p>The visit addresses the implications, surveillance plan and follow-up decisions. The separately reported scan interpretation takes 10 minutes; qualifying E/M work takes 35 minutes.</p></div>'+reveal('Reveal the billing reasoning','Evaluate the separate E/M using its supported MDM or 35 qualifying minutes. Verify payer modifier-25 requirements. Do not add the separately reported scan time or count that interpretation again as independent interpretation within MDM.'),['R13','R12','R15'],'05 / Apply and reconcile')
slide('Reconcile the record, claim and productivity report','Proposed local quality workflow; no national audit target is implied.',flow('Record','Submitted claim','Remittance','Productivity credit')+cards(('Missing service?','Check whether documented, eligible work reached the claim.'),('Denied service?','Read the reason and verify policy before correcting or appealing.'),('Missing credit?','Review rendering identity and contract attribution; do not rebill a paid claim to fix an internal report.')),['R1'],'05 / Apply and reconcile')
slide('Clinical pearls: attribute the work accurately','Eight habits to take back to the clinic.',
 '<ol class="pearls">'+''.join(f'<li>{x}</li>' for x in ['Start with the service delivered.','Check the payer and actual setting.','Keep wRVUs, payment and compensation separate.','Support the E/M level with MDM or eligible time.','Distinguish scan work from separate management.','Identify who performed each service.','Verify the physician–APP billing pathway.','Reconcile claims and productivity credit.'])+'</ol><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="quiz.html?track=physician">Physician quiz · 12 questions</a><a class="button" href="quiz.html?track=app">APP quiz · 12 questions</a></div>', ['R1','R2','R5'],'06 / Take it into practice')
slide('Evidence and controversies: identify what governs the decision','Payment policy, payer variation and local compensation are different layers.',cards(('Established rules','Medicare publishes service and billing requirements; CPT defines coding concepts.'),('Payer-dependent','Consultation recognition, maternity arrangements and contract payment may differ.'),('Unresolved / local','How should team-based care, coordination and protected teaching time receive fair credit?'))+call('A useful research question: does better service attribution improve accuracy without increasing documentation burden? This is an educational proposal, not a proven intervention.'),['R2','R6','R12'],'06 / Take it into practice')
